# Options list (row Audio) -> Audio page; Music row LEFT x2, DOWN to Speech, LEFT; back (CIRCLE).
key X
wait audiosettings.gum
sleep 3
mark audio page default
key LEFT
sleep 2
key LEFT
sleep 2
mark audio Music lowered
key DOWN
sleep 2
key LEFT
sleep 2
mark audio Speech lowered
key DOWN
sleep 2
key DOWN
sleep 2
key LEFT
sleep 2
mark audio Headset lowered
key O
sleep 3
mark back on the options list
